/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-19T17:16:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T19:38:35Z","closed_at":"2026-05-20T19:38:35Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.2-stable\n\n### System information\n\nMacBook M1 (2020), MacOS Tahoe 26.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the texture assigned to `application/config/icon` is assigned to a TextureRect in a scene that is currently open in the editor, the iOS exporter uses a heavily compressed version of the image for the .appiconset icons. This leads to noticeable blurry images, even for the 1024 version of the icon.\n\n## Theory on why this happens\n\n- Because the project icon is an imported `CompressedTexture2D`, icon export goes through `ResourceLoader::load(..., CACHE_MODE_REUSE)` and a `texture_2d_get()` readback.\n- `CACHE_MODE_REUSE` means that if any open scene references the icon (e.g. a TextureRect), export reuses that already-loaded, GPU-resident texture.\n- In this state the readback returns a degraded, downscaled-looking image, which _export_icons then upscales/resizes to every icon size producing blurry icons at all sizes.\n\n## Possibly relevant source code\n\n[`platform/ios/export/export_plugin.cpp`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.6.2-stable/platform/ios/export/export_plugin.cpp) (_export_icons, line 233; project-icon branch line 286–300):\n\n```\nicon_path = get_project_setting(p_preset, \"application/config/icon\");\nRef<Image> img = _load_icon_or_splash_image(icon_path, &err);\n...\nimg->resize(side_size, side_size, (Image::Interpolation)(p_preset->get(\"application/icon_interpolation\").operator int()));\nimg->save_png(...);\n```\n\n[`editor/export/editor_export_platform.cpp`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.6.2-stable/editor/export/editor_export_platform.cpp) (_load_icon_or_splash_image, line 95):\n\n```\nRef<Texture2D> texture = ResourceLoader::load(p_path, \"\", ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_REUSE, r_error);\nif (texture.is_valid()) {\n    image = texture->get_image();   // CompressedTexture2D::get_image()\n    ...\n}\nif (image.is_null()) {              // only reached if NOT an imported resource\n    ImageLoader::load_image(p_path, image);\n}\n```\n\n[`scene/resources/compressed_texture.cpp`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.6.2-stable/scene/resources/compressed_texture.cpp) (CompressedTexture2D::get_image(), line 240):\n\n```\nreturn RS::get_singleton()->texture_2d_get(texture);   // GPU/RenderingServer round-trip\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the minimal project below.\n- Try exporting to iOS with no scenes open (you might need to supply an Apple TeamID), and look at the resulting .appiconset icons. Notice that the 1024 version looks sharp.\n- Now open the scene \"scene_with_icon\". Try exporting again, and notice that the .appiconset icons are all blurry, including the 1024 version.\n\nA few notes\n- The icon.png import setting has Detect 3D set to Disabled, but this does not affect the result. Neither does the mipmap generate setting.\n- I did not test using an SVG file - only PNG.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[blurry-icon-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28023535/blurry-icon-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119579/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}